# Samsung M2020 Series (USB ID 0x04e8:0x3321)
# Override the Samsung-wide "soft-reset" quirk — on this model the
# soft reset invalidates the device handle (LIBUSB_ERROR_NOT_FOUND / -5)
# after the print data is sent, causing the printer to discard its buffer
# and not print. Use no-reattach + unidir instead.
0x04e8 0x3321 no-reattach unidir
